{{status
| name                   = Covered In Frost
| type                   = Debuff
| icon = Frost status icon.png
| description = You have less Critical Strike Chance and you take Increased Cold Damage.
| bonuses                = {{c|mod|50% less Critical Strike Chance}}<br>{{c|mod|20% increased Cold Damage Taken}}
}}

'''Covered In Frost''' is a [[debuff]] that causes the affected target to have less [[critical strike chance]] and increased [[cold]] [[damage taken]].

==Related skills==
{{Query stat related skill gems
|type=active
|where = skill.description LIKE "%Cover%Frost%" OR skill.stat_text LIKE "%Cover%Frost%"
|stat_page=Covered in Frost
}}

{{Query stat related skill gems
|type=support
|where = skill.description LIKE "%Cover%Frost%" OR skill.stat_text LIKE "%Cover%Frost%" OR skill.skill_id LIKE "%Hiveborn%"
|stat_page=Covered in Frost
}}

==Related unique items==
{{Drop enabled unique item table
|where=BINARY items.stat_text LIKE "%Cover%Frost%"
|large=1
|base_item=1
|level=1
|stat=1
}}

==Related modifiers==
{{Query spawnable modifiers
|where=mod_stats.id LIKE "%Cover%frost%" AND domain NOT IN ("38")
|stat_text=1
|spawn_weights=1
|level=1
|generation_type =1
|domain=1
}}

==Passives==
{{Query passive skills
|where=
  passive_skill_stats.id LIKE "%Frost%"
}}

==Monsters==
The following [[monster]]s use "Cover In Frost" skills:
* [[Mercenary]] that use special Vortex skill (id: [[Skill:VortexMercenary|VortexMercenary]])

